cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use bdd2pw, please cite it as below. The DOI is the concept DOI and resolves to the latest archived version; a specific version has its own DOI on its Zenodo page."
type: software
title: "bdd2pw: Live-DOM Page Object Scaffolding from Gherkin Specifications via the Microsoft Playwright MCP"
abstract: >-
  bdd2pw is an open-source Node.js test-generation tool that produces compiling
  Playwright TypeScript test suites from Gherkin behaviour specifications via
  live-DOM page object scaffolding using the Microsoft Playwright MCP.
  Validated on 7 domain packs with API rule enforcement, JSON scenarios,
  merge-mode authoring, hook fixtures, and LLM batching diagnostics.
authors:
